// Editing in the working VM when changing the code with the ct code instance (§7.4, §10.1): editing
// restarts elaboration (rollback all changes and parsing programs anew); the result is the same -
// revisions of the changed node former, instance cache and machine code are not reset.
// 
// Tune - Changes are rolled back and made again.
// program: ct_inst_edit.vish
run
// expect: 300 15 7
check
// expect: пересчитано
edit other
other() => 8;
.
// expect: функция other заменена
check
// expect: пересчитано 2 экземпл. (other, main)
run
// expect: 300 15 8
jit
// expect: jit  scale(i64)
edit tune
tune(f, op, k) => ct {
  f.body = ast.operation{op, array{ast.name{"x"}, ast.int{k + 1}}};
};
.
// expect: функция tune заменена
run
// expect: 400 16 8
check
// expect: пересчитано 3 экземпл. (scale, shift, main)
